    "RULING: Boost types | only Use Your Body (Cunning) is sourced; every other Boost has type null and typeUnknown true until its card face is found, and a typed rack (Grognak, Survival Guide, Covert Ops, Astounding Tales) may draw a typeUnknown Boost as a match | the Full Card List gives names only, and an empty typed rack would stall the settlement phase | Unsourced | CH p5; FCL p1-3",
    "RULING: Placeholder Boosts | 34 Boost records carry a real name and no text and have effect {code: todo} (no effect in battle); 4 Boost records are sourced | no local source prints the others | Unsourced | FCL p1-3",
    "RULING: Boost scope | the 13 starter Boosts, the 24 Settlement Deck 1 Boosts (Powerful Attack and Defensive Positioning are in both) and the three the errata names; later decks (Aim for the Gap and following) are not entered | the starter and first settlement deck are the playable slice | Confirmed | FCL p1-3"
